    <property name="hide_description" type="boolean">true</property>
    <property name="description" type="string">Pasco Collision Carts with built-in velcros ensure that the cart stick together after collision.
The cart on the right is approximately 1000 g while the cart on the left is 500 g.. Conservation of momentum is applicable, because the force of collision is much higher than the friction. Hence we can assume that there is negligible net external force.</property>
